# --- the unknowns a place can hold (unknown_aN are fresh unknowns for "anything")
@pq68 fact
  holds unknown unknown_x
@pq69 fact
  holds unknown_text unknown_x "X: the thing the request asks for"
@pq70 fact
  holds unknown unknown_m
@pq71 fact
  holds unknown_text unknown_m "M: each member of the group the request is about"
@pq72 fact
  holds unknown unknown_v
@pq73 fact
  holds unknown_text unknown_v "V: the value to compare or rank (highest, lowest, before, more than another)"
@pq74 fact
  holds unknown unknown_w
@pq75 fact
  holds unknown_text unknown_w "W: a value the request limits (more than a number, between two numbers, before a year)"
@pq76 fact
  holds unknown unknown_p
@pq77 fact
  holds unknown_text unknown_p "P: another unknown thing (the same P in every statement)"
@pq78 fact
  holds unknown unknown_q
@pq79 fact
  holds unknown_text unknown_q "Q: a second other unknown thing (the same Q in every statement)"

# --- structural early exits of the place filler (switch one off by removing its fact)
@pq80 fact
  holds heuristic single_allowed_option
@pq81 fact
  holds heuristic asked_into_last_place
@pq82 fact
  holds heuristic asked_from_single_unknown

